{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtJPDnaT1oFo4PozUmjc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two things are settled. The returned `hidden_24` is post-final-norm (its RMS of ~4.1 matches the final norm scale, and the logit lens reproduces the returned top-5 exactly), and `hidden_23` is the residual stream before the last layer. Before the causal test, one oddity: layer 23 heads 0 and 7 had identical induction scores (0.456 / 0.453) and identical attention entropy (4.403) to three decimals, even though they use different KV heads (heads 0–3 share KV head 0, heads 4–7 share KV head 1). That could be a coincidence of averaging, or duplicated weights, which would hint at an unnatural modification. I'll compare their query/gate/output weights directly, and run a quick scan of all 48 full-attention heads for unusual weight norms relative to their layer peers.\n\n```python\n# Hypothesis: (check) L23 H0 & H7 identical stats -> maybe duplicated/tampered weights; scan head weight norms for outliers.\ndef head_slices(layer):\n    q = load_original(f'model.language_model.layers.{layer}.self_attn.q_proj.weight')\n    o = load_original(f'model.language_model.layers.{layer}.self_attn.o_proj.weight')\n    return q, o\nq23, o23 = head_slices(23)\nQ = lambda q, h: q[h*512: h*512+256]; Gt = lambda q, h: q[h*512+256: (h+1)*512]; O = lambda o, h: o[:, h*256:(h+1)*256]\nprint('L23 q cos(h0,h7):', torch.nn.functional.cosine_similarity(Q(q23,0).flatten(), Q(q23,7).flatten(), 0).item(),\n      ' o cos:', torch.nn.functional.cosine_similarity(O(o23,0).flatten(), O(o23,7).flatten(), 0).item())\nA23 = np.load(D5 + 'attn_23.npy', mmap_mode='r')\nprint('max |attn h0 - h7| text0:', np.abs(np.asarray(A23[0,0,:500,:500]) - np.asarray(A23[0,7,:500,:500])).max())\nrows_n = []\nfor layer in [3,7,11,15,19,23]:\n    q, o = head_slices(layer)\n    for h in range(8):\n        rows_n.append(dict(layer=layer, head=h, qn=Q(q,h).norm().item(), gn=Gt(q,h).norm().item(), on=O(o,h).norm().item()))\nNN = pd.DataFrame(rows_n)\nprint(NN.pivot(index='head', columns='layer', values='on').round(2).to_string())\nprint(NN.pivot(index='head', columns='layer', values='gn').round(2).to_string())\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3004,"cache_read_input_tokens":80446,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3004},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"37ae3ac5-393a-4da3-8caf-f8ba0ea8f929","uuid":"93005196-b48d-42ed-84c1-af15ed0839d8","timestamp":"2026-11-10T00:28:47.816Z","request_id":"req_011CgtJPCd8f54aRMuD17F1p"}
